Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 06:44:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 59/75] Route Finder overlay drops to ExternalFileDrop

AppKit files skip path-paste on the webview;
Zig ships paths, coords, tab to the engine.
Proto fifty and export glue land together.
